            "• <em>Equal Opportunity and Sexual Harassment Redressal:</em> Strict enforcement of the Gender Sensitization and Internal Complaints Committee (GSICC) regulations across all bar associations to ensure safe working conditions.<br/>" +
            "In conclusion, the Indian judiciary cannot command genuine democratic legitimacy so long as the gavel remains an almost exclusive male preserve. Bridging the gender gap in the judiciary is an urgent constitutional necessity that will enrich jurisprudence, restore institutional fairness, and realize the promise of substantive equality envisioned by the Framers of our Constitution."
